# Private terms refused before publication (ci/publish_check.py and
# scripts/pre-push). Copy to private/scan-terms.txt, which git ignores, and
# never commit the real file.
#
# Format: one term per line, case-insensitive. Blank lines and lines starting
# with "#" are ignored. A line is an exact text (as grep -F); a line starting
# with "re:" is a Python regular expression (ci/publish_check.py only;
# scripts/pre-push reads every line as exact text).
# A finding prints the term's number and line here, never the term itself.
#
# The terms below are fictitious examples.
example-client-name
example-internal-host.invalid
re:example-project-\d+
